I would have used the wishes differently, but, in any case,
you're well ahead of the game and would probably ascend if
you were pretty much spoiled. AC-15, MR and reflection is
enough for an experienced player through Gehennom, all the
way if you want a difficult challenge. I prefer something
like -35 for the planes.

Daggers are the ranger's (and rogue and wizard, maybe most
classes) best friend for this part of the game, and you
should find plenty. They get a +2 to hit which you need in
the early game and you get to add a strength bonus which
doesn't apply to arrows.

